STUDY RESOURCE: Operational NetCDF and GRIB2 Manipulation Guide
Topic: Multidimensional Atmospheric Array Processing with Python xarray & Cartopy
Target Competency: Python (Level 4), Data Analytics (Level 4)

Summary of Topics:
1. Opening NetCDF4 datasets with xarray.open_dataset()
2. Spatial slicing and temporal resampling of ERA5 reanalysis grids
3. Cartopy projection transformations (PlateCarree, LambertConformal)
4. Calculating geostrophic wind components and vorticity fields
5. Generating automated cyclone track and intensity plots
